  "description": "Cedric Roberge built an app called Pep AI. In just ONE MONTH, he hit 10,000 users and $30K in revenue (wow!!). This video breaks down how a college student found a trending niche, built the app, and scaled to $30K/month. \n\n*Free iOS Bootcamp:* https://clickhubspot.com/60ej \n\nFollow Cedric: https://twitter.com/Cedric_Roberge\nCheck out Pep AI: https://pepaiapp.com/\n\n🔔 Follow the Second Channel: @StarterStoryBuild \n🏁 We're hiring: starterstory.com/jobs\n\nChapters:\n0:00 - Knowing where to look\n0:53 - Who is Cedric?\n1:13 - App data and overview\n2:20 - Founder background\n3:19 - Build timeline and tech stack\n4:44 - Start building with AI\n5:40 - How to find a great app idea\n6:51 - Identifying viral ideas\n8:09 - Find ideas on social media\n9:11 - Review existing apps\n9:59 - Growth and Marketing \n12:06 - App Demo\n13:348 - Advice to founders\n15:13 - Pat and Gus reflections: the power of building with AI",
